# Template for local environment variables.
#
# How to use:
#   1. Copy this file to a new file called .env  (cp .env.example .env)
#   2. Replace each placeholder with your real value in .env
#   3. Never commit .env. It is already listed in .gitignore.
#
# When the project needs a new key, add its name here with a placeholder value.

# Exa search API key. Get one from https://dashboard.exa.ai/api-keys
EXA_API_KEY=your-exa-api-key-here
